OL,3,AMayors to get powers to overrule local
OL,4,Acouncils on planning decisions
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousing minister Matthew Pennycook said
OL,7,Fthe powers were an "essential part of
OL,8,Fthe toolkit that mayors need to
OL,9,Feffectively deliver new homes and
OL,10,Fregeneration".
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
