OL,3,AZelensky should be asked what he knew
OL,4,Aabout government corruption, sacked
OL,5,Aminister tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe told the BBC a money laundering
OL,8,Finvestigation announced last week meant
OL,9,FZelensky should be asked about his
OL,10,Fawareness of potential corruption in
OL,11,Fhis inner circle.
OL,13,FBut he said he had not himself seen the
OL,14,Fpresident engage in any corrupt
OL,15,Factivity.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
